    "assert": {
      "_comment": "Audits the deployed site, where the font actually swaps and layout shift is real. Boolean assertions aggregate pessimistically; numeric budgets take the median. robots-txt is excluded because Lighthouse intermittently fails to fetch it when 25 runs hit the same deployment in a minute, which is an artifact of the audit and not of the site.",
      "_comment_budgets": "Transfer budgets are bytes (275000 = 275,000 B, not KiB) and per route. Home carries Fig. 1's poster and renderer: 275,000, raised to 280,000 by the owner (2026-09-30) for Vercel Web Analytics, which only production loads (277,286 B there), on condition of mobile performance 90 or more. /iv-surface was 264,185 B on the preview before M6 and held at 265,000; its new Fig. 1 took it to 296,649 B (M7), and the owner raised it to 300,000 on condition that its mobile performance stays at 90 or more and its CLS at 0 (2026-09-28; measured 297,269 B, performance 99–100, CLS 0, with its smooth still frame loaded only once the page is idle). The other papers keep 260,000, raised to 261,000 by the owner (2026-09-28) for M8's site-wide growth: the stylesheet (+532 B) and the runtime's worker support (+440 B). Each new route is added with its measured budget. /order-book loads its figures lazily and is held to 300,000 (M7). /market's market runs in a worker loaded when its figure goes live, which on a device with a GPU is during the audit: measured 317,089 B on the preview with the worker's own scripts blocked there, about 331,000 B with them, and the owner raised it to 335,000 (2026-09-28), on condition of performance 90 or more and CLS 0, keeping the shock that plays as the figure comes into view. /about, /cv, /nucarbon and /adconfirm share the papers' 261,000 (measured on the M9 preview: 259,372, 237,233, 244,311 and 238,538 B).",
      "assertMatrix": [
        {
          "matchingUrlPattern": "^https://iliaduda-site\\.vercel\\.app/$",
          "assertions": {
            "categories:accessibility": [
              "error",
              {
                "minScore": 1,
                "aggregationMethod": "pessimistic"
              }
            ],
            "cumulative-layout-shift": [
              "error",
              {
                "maxNumericValue": 0.01,
                "aggregationMethod": "median"
              }
            ],
            "largest-contentful-paint": [
              "error",
              {
                "maxNumericValue": 2500,
                "aggregationMethod": "median"
              }
            ],
            "resource-summary:third-party:count": [
              "error",
              {
                "maxNumericValue": 0,
                "aggregationMethod": "pessimistic"
              }
            ],
            "color-contrast": [
              "error",
              {
                "minScore": 1,
                "aggregationMethod": "pessimistic"
              }
            ],
            "heading-order": [
              "error",
              {
                "minScore": 1,
                "aggregationMethod": "pessimistic"
              }
            ],
            "robots-txt": "off",
